/logs/
*/logs/
*/*/logs/
*.db

# Temporary local override

# /output/ — matches only a directory named output at the repository root
#  (e.g., output/), not in subdirectories
# The leading / anchors the pattern to the root of the repo.
/output/

# `ape sprint reconcile` takes an advisory lock on a `<tracker>.lock` sidecar
# and never unlinks it — releasing the lock and deleting the file are
# different acts, and deleting one another process may be waiting on loses
# the mutual exclusion. The file is a runtime artifact and belongs in no
# history; this repo's testdata project acquires one whenever a test or a
# manual run reconciles it. `ape doctor`'s sprint.lock_ignored row is the
# check that tells a real project the same thing.
*.lock
